{"text":"purananuru","n":265,"lines":["ஊர்நனி இறந்த பார்முதிர் பறந்தலை","ஓங்குநிலை வேங்கை ஒள்ளிணர் நறுவீப்","போந்தை அம் தோட்டின் புனைந்தனர் தொடுத்துப்","பல்ஆன் கோவலர் படலை சூட்டக்","கல்ஆ யினையே கடுமான் தோன்றல்","வான்ஏறு புரையும்நின் தாள்நிழல் வாழ்க்கைப்","பரிசிலர் செல்வம் அன்றியும் விரிதார்க்","கடும்பகட்டு யானை வேந்தர்","ஒடுங்க வென்றியும் நின்னொடு செலவே"],"tr":["ūrnaṉi iṟanta pārmutir paṟantalai","ōṅkunilai vēṅkai oḷḷiṇar naṟuvīp","pōntai am tōṭṭiṉ puṉaintaṉar toṭuttup","palāṉ kōvalar paṭalai cūṭṭak","kalā yiṉaiyē kaṭumāṉ tōṉṟal","vāṉēṟu puraiyumniṉ tāḷniḻal vāḻkkaip","paricilar celvam aṉṟiyum viritārk","kaṭumpakaṭṭu yāṉai vēntar","oṭuṅka veṉṟiyum niṉṉoṭu celavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"karantai","tinai_ta":"கரந்தை","turai_ta":"கையறுநிலை","poet_ta":"சோணாட்டு முகையலூர்ச் சிறுகருந்தும்பியார்","poet_tr":"Cōṇāṭṭu Mukaiyalūrc Ciṟukaruntumpiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"9 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"9×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 32, veṇcīr 4"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 22, veṇṭaḷai 11, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"ஊர்நனி","tr":"ūrnaṉi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஊர்","tr":"ūr"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"நனி","tr":"naṉi"}]},{"text":"யிறந்த","tr":"yiṟanta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிறந்","tr":"yiṟan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"பார்முதிர்","tr":"pārmutir","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பார்","tr":"pār"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முதிர்","tr":"mutir"}]},{"text":"பறந்தலை","tr":"paṟantalai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பறந்","tr":"paṟan"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலை","tr":"talai"}]}],[{"text":"யோங்குநிலை","tr":"yōṅkunilai","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோங்","tr":"yōṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குநி","tr":"kuni"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"la